{
    "title": "Bricks Ball Journey",
    "description": "Welcome to \"Bricks Ball Journey\"! Bricks Ball Journey is a globally popular classic brick-breaking game.\r\n\r\nBased on the accumulation of \"Bricks Ball Crusher\", we have improved all aspects of the experience and content of \"Brick Ball Journey\", hoping that it will bring you more fun. The game inherits more than 300 skill blocks and skill balls from the previous game, and introduces target as the main mode of gameplay. \r\n\r\nWe also bring a new \"Adventure Mode\", which is the adventure story of Amelia. She meets her partner - Echo, a feline creature from an alien planet that has mysterious powers.\r\n\r\nWhat are you waiting for? Let's explore the journey of the brick world together. You can constantly unlock different landscapes and themes from around the world, and you can also decorate all the scenes to your liking. \r\n\r\nIntroduction to normal mode:\r\n- The ball will fly in any direction you touch\r\n- Find the best position and angle to hit each brick \r\n- Complete levels by collecting targets\r\n- When breaking bricks, never let them touch the bottom\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Free play\r\n- Smooth and accurate aiming\r\n- 4000 + levels\r\n- Superb physical playing method experience \r\n- More than 300 skill balls and skill blocks \r\n- Support offline (no Internet access) games \r\n- Support multiplayer games\r\n- Support achievements and leader boards\r\n- Support subscription",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to &quot;Bricks Ball Journey&quot;! Bricks Ball Journey is a globally popular classic brick-breaking game.<br><br>Based on the accumulation of &quot;Bricks Ball Crusher&quot;, we have improved all aspects of the experience and content of &quot;Brick Ball Journey&quot;, hoping that it will bring you more fun. The game inherits more than 300 skill blocks and skill balls from the previous game, and introduces target as the main mode of gameplay. <br><br>We also bring a new &quot;Adventure Mode&quot;, which is the adventure story of Amelia. She meets her partner - Echo, a feline creature from an alien planet that has mysterious powers.<br><br>What are you waiting for? Let&#39;s explore the journey of the brick world together. You can constantly unlock different landscapes and themes from around the world, and you can also decorate all the scenes to your liking. <br><br>Introduction to normal mode:<br>- The ball will fly in any direction you touch<br>- Find the best position and angle to hit each brick <br>- Complete levels by collecting targets<br>- When breaking bricks, never let them touch the bottom<br><br>Features:<br>- Free play<br>- Smooth and accurate aiming<br>- 4000 + levels<br>- Superb physical playing method experience <br>- More than 300 skill balls and skill blocks <br>- Support offline (no Internet access) games <br>- Support multiplayer games<br>- Support achievements and leader boards<br>- Support subscription",
